HB0131 Ballot drop boxes-prohibition.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Knapp, Angelos, Neiman, Ottman,
Rodriguez-Williams, Webb, Wharff and Winter and
Senator(s) Hutchings, Ide, Kolb, Laursen, D and
Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to elections; prohibiting the use of drop boxes for delivery of
ballots as specified; and providing for an effective date.
1/8/2025 Bill Number Assigned
1/9/2025 H Received for Introduction
1/16/2025 H Introduced and Referred to H07 - Corporations
1/22/2025 H07 - Corporations:Recommend Amend and Do Pass 8-1-0-0-0
